  (descr "Waveshare ESP32-P4-Module, hand-solder variant: copper/mask pads extended 1.5 mm beyond module edge (2.25x0.7 mm). No solder paste: the module is hand-soldered after JLC SMT, so the stencil must not print on these pads (review dfm-04). Same pad numbering as Waveshare_ESP32-P4-Module.")
  (tags "ESP32-P4 ESP32-C6 module castellated Waveshare")

